quest_1401_s_36","text":"So I don't think it's hard to make the decision!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_37","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_37","text":"The surface?","jump":"m_subquest_1401_s_39"},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_38","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_38","text":"The Royal Road?","jump":"m_subquest_1401_s_41"},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"twinkle","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_39","text":"I knew you'd pick up the hint, Commander, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"twinkle","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_40","text":"You never disappoint.","jump":"m_subquest_1401_s_43"},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"twinkle","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_41","text":"Huh? Where the heck did you come up with Royal Road?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"twinkle","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_42","text":"I was dropping hints about the surface!","jump":"m_subquest_1401_s_43"},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"twinkle","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_43","text":"That's where you and Rapi went,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"twinkle","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_44","text":"so that's where you and I have to go as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_45","text":"And what if we meet a Rapture?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"twinkle","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_46","text":"Hmmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"twinkle","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1401_s_47","text":"Then I'll toss you on my back","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1401_s_48","typ